## Execution
Runs: batch

After explicit user approval and successful `stage03_analysis.py approve`, submit `scripts/submit.sh` through `python3 <workspace>/_system/executorlib.py submit --workspace <project dir> <script>` using the configured executor. Request 1 CPU, 4 GB memory and 10 minutes wall time where supported by that executor. Expected runtime is under 5 minutes for six samples; expected output size is under 10 MB. Capture stdout and stderr inside this analysis directory. No analysis code executes before approval. If execution fails, report the actual error and stop; a revised method requires a new plan.
